        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148060/extras/220f1079b628171ced48dafdae9ef62f.avif?t=1781605443\" width=614 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A phone call from a small, out of state police force was the last thing writer Penelope Pendrick was expecting that morning. But, it wasn't long after that she was boarding a flight to the quaint old town of Carlisle, Connecticut. When debriefed, Penelope learns her job is to join the search for three missing people; an older man who owns a local bookstore, a mysterious woman who keeps to herself, and a troublemaking teenage boy – the only common link between them being that they disappeared from the same town, within the same week. The Sergeant is stumped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once she begins to unravel the case, Penelope realizes that there’s something deeper – stranger – going on here. Unusual ties form between four deceptive suspects, each with something to gain and each with something to lose. Motives and suspicions weave in and out as Penelope uses her wits and penchant for rule-breaking to search for answers; some of which died with an eccentric and mysterious local artist fifty years ago. As the danger escalates, a timer begins to tick down on the lives of the missing. All that  Penelope knows for sure is that there’s more to the town of Carlisle than it would appear, and that one wrong move could make this first case her last. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148060/extras/e372ca7f83f25a773dfeec1e3a7c253c.avif?t=1781605443\" width=614 height=82 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore the town of Carlisle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Interrogate four unique suspects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Steer the conversation with non-linear dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your choices matter - speak wisely!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Solve unique puzzles inspired by a famous artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Don't get caught when you snoop!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Check every corner with your magnifying glass</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Watch the clock to know who's around and when...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use the landline to call friends or order pizza!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Examine any inventory item for details</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose between two difficulty levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Read in-game notes and check off your checklist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Type in answers to questions to progress the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Join Penelope on her first official case!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148060/extras/b2aa7cb8a0f8a4e08bd4225fe837d8da.avif?t=1781605443\" width=614 height=82 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Characteristics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Point &amp; Click Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > First Person Point of View</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Single Player Game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fully Voice-Acted</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Detailed Environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Complete Closed Captioning </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mystery Adventure Genre </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148060/extras/2adf275fa891edf82a4d4cdcf54c704b.avif?t=1781605443\" width=614 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: The game is NOT Steam Deck Verified. Some users with the Deck experience issues with character and cutscene animations, such as blurriness, pixilation, or missing animations.</p>",
